## @rationale
## Q: Why complete duty clauses instead of topic keywords?
## A: A topic label survives loss of its required action or authority; these clauses bind the whole declared responsibility.
## Q: Why retain full observations and supplied-digest concealment controls?
## A: Same-HEAD changes and new files must invalidate a verdict even if a producer repeats the old digest string.
