## - [_live_lines]: Live fixture clauses are separated from fenced examples; an unclosed fence refuses the surface.
## - [_contract_failures]: Fixed mandatory actions/order/authority are inspected; only actual lost or contradicted keys refuse.
## - [_observe_identity]: Owned scratch bytes and modes are observed beside declared labels; complete physical identity returns.
## - [_freshness_failures]: Required observations are compared and digests recomputed; stale, missing or concealed evidence refuses.
## - [_write_fixtures]: Complete pair bytes and provenance are written to owned scratch; hash/mode and manifest readback prove delivery.
## - [test_pm_card_and_norm_structure]: Actual draft cards, anchors and norm uniqueness are checked with current module markup.
