## - [test_pm_shipped_boundaries_and_coordination]: Current shipped duties and worked boundary examples are read and checked.
## - [test_pm_finite_weakened_fixtures]: Fixed whole-duty losses/grants produce the exact known loss set, preserving bounded atomic controls.
## - [test_pm_isolated_compound_constituents]: One compound duty is omitted or contradicted; its singleton refusal and unchanged counterparts are read back.
## - [test_pm_identity_freshness_fixtures]: Actual scratch content changes at equal declared HEAD; stale and concealed evidence is refused.
## - [test_pm_required_evidence_and_optional_absence]: Optional detail is absent honestly; missing required input/HEAD/candidate observations still refuse.
